<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDEN AND SOUTH AFRICA LEVEL 1-1 DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDEN AND SOUTH AFRICA LEVEL 1-1 DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>VAXJO, SWEDEN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden and South Africa</p>
<p>were level 1-1 after the opening singles in their Davis Cup</p>
<p>tennis World Group second round tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Results (Swedish names first):</p>
<p>Thomas Enqvist beat Grant Stafford 7-5 2-6 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman lost to Wayne Ferreira beat Jonas Bjorkman 3-6</p>
<p>4-6 6-2 6-7 (3-7).</p>
</text>
